    "url": "https://github.com/hanshuebner/ipx-psu-replacement",
    "title": "GitHub - hanshuebner/ipx-psu-replacement",
    "snippet": "Sun SPARCstation IPC/IPX replacement power supply I've got tired of unsuccessfully trying to repair the APS-02 power supply that is built into Sun's SPARCstation IPC and IPX workstations, so I designed this replacement. It uses two encapsulated power supplies and a MAX8215 power supply monitoring chip to generate the SENS signal.   Summarize",
